WEBVTT

00:02.390 --> 00:06.860
<b>What was that about the Oniwaban Group
or the legendary manslayer?</b>

00:06.860 --> 00:09.110
<b>The true strongest is yours truly!</b>

00:09.110 --> 00:11.820
<b>There is nothing more wonderful
in this world than money!</b>

00:12.030 --> 00:13.030
<b>Die!</b>

00:13.780 --> 00:14.740
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

00:15.240 --> 00:16.370
<b>A Gatling gun!</b>

00:19.660 --> 00:20.490
<b>Shikijo!</b>

00:20.490 --> 00:21.950
<b>- Wha—
- Now!</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:23.080
<b>Run, Battosai!</b>

00:25.920 --> 00:28.040
<b>Which... Which one should be the target?</b>

00:33.090 --> 00:36.180
<b>Damn it, I'll start off
with the immobile Aoshi!</b>

00:36.180 --> 00:37.890
<b>I won't let you do that!</b>

00:37.890 --> 00:39.100
<b>Eat this!</b>

00:39.100 --> 00:41.470
<b>Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat!</b>

00:44.560 --> 00:45.560
<b>Shikijo!</b>

02:18.990 --> 02:22.990
<b>EPISODE 13:
BATTLE'S END</b>

02:24.580 --> 02:25.410
<b>Shikij—</b>

02:25.790 --> 02:28.750
<b>Whoa. Don't look at me like that.</b>

02:28.750 --> 02:30.420
<b>That's so not like you.</b>

02:30.790 --> 02:33.340
<b>I'm pretty satisfied.</b>

02:33.920 --> 02:36.590
<b>I was able to prove that my muscles,</b>

02:36.590 --> 02:40.720
<b>my pride and joy that I
even took drugs to obtain,</b>

02:40.720 --> 02:43.010
<b>could become a shield
that can win against bullets.</b>

02:43.800 --> 02:46.970
<b>It's just like what you said back then.</b>

02:51.440 --> 02:54.400
<b>I am invincible...</b>

03:04.740 --> 03:05.870
<b>Shikijo.</b>

03:07.490 --> 03:10.750
<b>That sack of meat
will be broken to smithereens</b>

03:10.750 --> 03:12.670
<b>with 200-bullet consecutive firing!</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:14.880
<b>Whoa, hold it right there!</b>

03:15.420 --> 03:19.170
<b>Hyottoko right here will take you on!</b>

03:19.340 --> 03:20.170
<b>Wha—</b>

03:20.170 --> 03:23.550
<b>Whoa! Don't shoot!
If you shoot too carelessly,</b>

03:23.550 --> 03:26.140
<b>this sack of oil
will catch fire and go boom!</b>

03:27.100 --> 03:29.020
<b>Brace yourself!</b>

03:29.020 --> 03:30.430
<b>I'll be right there!</b>

03:31.480 --> 03:33.190
<b>D-Don't come here!</b>

03:35.860 --> 03:36.900
<b>You fell for it.</b>

03:37.610 --> 03:40.740
<b>If I can't aim for the gut,
I'll just aim everywhere else!</b>

03:40.740 --> 03:43.450
<b>Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat!</b>

03:43.450 --> 03:44.280
<b>Hyottoko!</b>

03:46.080 --> 03:49.080
<b>You're the one that fell for it...</b>

03:50.660 --> 03:52.370
<b>- Wha—
- Take this!</b>

03:52.370 --> 03:53.670
<b>Dokusatsu Rasenbyo!</b>

03:58.380 --> 03:59.260
<b>Beshimi!</b>

03:59.710 --> 04:03.970
<b>Leader... it didn't work after all.</b>

04:04.340 --> 04:08.010
<b>Apologies. To the very end...</b>

04:08.010 --> 04:10.390
<b>we were useless.</b>

04:10.640 --> 04:12.890
<b>Beshimi. Hyottoko.</b>

04:19.650 --> 04:22.150
<b>Whew, close. That was close.</b>

04:22.650 --> 04:25.030
<b>If a street performance
like that did me in,</b>

04:25.030 --> 04:26.490
<b>it wouldn't even be a joke.</b>

04:26.490 --> 04:29.160
<b>But now I know for sure!</b>

04:29.160 --> 04:32.250
<b>Oniwaban are all useless,
no matter how many of you there are!</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:35.120
<b>From here on, it's the era of the Gatling!</b>

04:35.250 --> 04:38.250
<b>The ruler of the Gatling
will be the ruler of the world,</b>

04:38.250 --> 04:41.590
<b>and I will be its pioneer!</b>

04:41.800 --> 04:43.220
<b>Damn you!</b>

04:52.730 --> 04:53.810
<b>Battosai.</b>

04:54.690 --> 04:56.480
<b>How many seconds will it take you</b>

04:56.480 --> 04:59.820
<b>to pick up that Sakabato
and slice into Kanryu?</b>

05:00.150 --> 05:01.440
<b>Fifteen.</b>

05:01.440 --> 05:03.190
<b>No, if I have 10 seconds...</b>

05:03.440 --> 05:04.860
<b>10 seconds?</b>

05:04.860 --> 05:06.240
<b>That's going to be a bit rough.</b>

05:06.240 --> 05:07.070
<b>For what?</b>

05:07.070 --> 05:07.910
<b>Look.</b>

05:09.120 --> 05:12.750
<b>Beyond that door is a small lookout tower.</b>

05:12.750 --> 05:15.750
<b>Megumi Takani is confined there.</b>

05:15.750 --> 05:17.000
<b>Han'nya?</b>

05:17.000 --> 05:21.460
<b>It's not like I wasn't thinking
about that woman.</b>

05:21.880 --> 05:26.930
<b>It just happened
that Lord Aoshi was more precious to me.</b>

05:27.180 --> 05:29.970
<b>I'm trusting you to take care of the rest,
Himura Battosai.</b>

05:30.720 --> 05:31.850
<b>Wait, Han'nya!</b>

05:57.620 --> 06:00.000
<b>Hey, he's been beaten again.</b>

06:00.000 --> 06:02.800
<b>He's still quite far from being
an opponent for our leader.</b>

06:02.960 --> 06:06.720
<b>Well, if we work him a bit harder,
he might be of some use.</b>

06:07.050 --> 06:09.930
<b>Don't stare at me so much.
You're ruining my concentration.</b>

06:08.720 --> 06:09.930
<b>WINDY RUSSIAN EMPEROR SEAL</b>

06:10.050 --> 06:12.720
<b>We're just giving you advice.</b>

06:10.050 --> 06:13.680
<b>WINDY RUSSIAN EMPEROR SEAL</b>

06:13.890 --> 06:16.520
<b>That's right. You should feel thankful.</b>

06:16.770 --> 06:19.480
<b>Don't cause too much trouble
for our leader.</b>

06:19.690 --> 06:22.480
<b>Sheesh. Each and every one of you...</b>

06:22.980 --> 06:24.440
<b>Are you in pain?</b>

06:24.900 --> 06:26.150
<b>No.</b>

06:26.150 --> 06:30.700
<b>Compared to the life I've had so far,
this is basically nothing.</b>

06:30.700 --> 06:34.950
<b>I see. But it's better if you
don't smile too much during training.</b>

06:35.700 --> 06:36.790
<b>You create an opening.</b>

06:37.750 --> 06:40.250
<b>Was I smiling?</b>

06:40.830 --> 06:42.460
<b>It looked that way to me.</b>

06:52.720 --> 06:56.060
<b>Was I smiling?</b>

07:19.040 --> 07:22.210
<b>Using the monster-face
as a decoy to attack.</b>

07:22.210 --> 07:24.630
<b>A tactic you'd expect from a hitokiri.</b>

07:24.630 --> 07:27.840
<b>But in the end,
every last one of them died in vain!</b>

07:28.090 --> 07:30.760
<b>Years of training is useless!
Useless in front of the Gatling!</b>

07:31.050 --> 07:33.680
<b>Useless trash! Trash! Rubbish!</b>

07:33.800 --> 07:36.930
<b>Oh, I'm so glad
I was able to buy the Gatling!</b>

07:36.930 --> 07:39.600
<b>Hooray, me! Hooray, Gatling!</b>

07:39.600 --> 07:41.850
<b>Hooray, money!</b>

07:42.100 --> 07:43.060
<b>Die!</b>

07:43.060 --> 07:44.020
<b>- Kenshin!
- Kenshin!</b>

07:44.020 --> 07:46.070
<b>Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat! Gat!</b>

07:48.530 --> 07:50.150
<b>Look closely at what you have.</b>

07:50.690 --> 07:53.240
<b>It fires 200 rounds every minute.</b>

07:53.740 --> 07:56.870
<b>If you shoot without thinking
of consequences, you soon will...</b>

07:57.370 --> 07:58.790
<b>I'm out of bullets?</b>

07:59.410 --> 08:01.080
<b>Their deaths were not in vain.</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:08.590
<b>The lives of the four members
of Oniwaban Group</b>

08:08.590 --> 08:10.510
<b>were victorious over your Gatling gun.</b>

08:12.930 --> 08:13.800
<b>H-Help m—</b>

08:13.970 --> 08:17.930
<b>If you're begging for your life,
just ask your money that you love so much!</b>

08:24.020 --> 08:25.900
<b>As I'd expect from you, Kenshin.</b>

08:25.900 --> 08:28.650
<b>Even when you're pissed,
you still uphold the refusal to kill.</b>

08:32.820 --> 08:35.530
<b>Leave him alone for now, that you should.</b>

08:36.030 --> 08:37.320
<b>You're right.</b>

08:37.830 --> 08:38.660
<b>Kenshin!</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:40.660
<b>I'm fine.</b>

08:41.290 --> 08:43.500
<b>I just faltered a little bit, that I did.</b>

08:44.120 --> 08:45.250
<b>Let's hurry.</b>

08:45.250 --> 08:46.830
<b>Miss Megumi is waiting for us.</b>

08:46.830 --> 08:47.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:49.550 --> 08:55.220
<b><i>Aoshi Shinomori. You're quite a strong one
if you can injure Kenshin this much.</i></b>

08:56.680 --> 09:04.060
<b><i>But in this battle, the wounds
that you suffered were a lot bigger.</i></b>

09:15.280 --> 09:17.070
<b>The gunshots are over.</b>

09:17.070 --> 09:18.120
<b>What in the world...</b>

09:22.870 --> 09:24.830
<b>- Argh! So irritating!
- Argh! So irritating!</b>

09:26.870 --> 09:29.080
<b>All right! No ambushers!</b>

09:29.080 --> 09:31.460
<b>Yahiko. Sanosuke.</b>

09:31.960 --> 09:33.920
<b>Sorry to make you wait, that is.</b>

09:33.920 --> 09:34.800
<b>Ken-san...</b>

09:34.800 --> 09:36.340
<b>Those wounds...</b>

09:37.510 --> 09:40.260
<b>I had a tiny bit of trouble, that I did.</b>

09:40.260 --> 09:44.930
<b>But more so, I am glad you didn't
suffer any major wounds, that I am.</b>

09:45.560 --> 09:46.980
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:48.060 --> 09:50.690
<b>I dragged you into this mess,</b>

09:50.690 --> 09:52.940
<b>and on top of that,
I had you face danger.</b>

09:53.650 --> 09:55.400
<b>But please rest assured.</b>

09:55.900 --> 09:58.990
<b>The source of the disaster
will be eliminated soon.</b>

09:58.990 --> 10:00.490
<b>Miss Megumi!</b>

10:00.490 --> 10:02.910
<b>With the single thought
of wanting to see my family,</b>

10:02.910 --> 10:05.000
<b>I have been regretfully living my life.</b>

10:05.750 --> 10:09.750
<b>But I am truly glad
that I was able to meet all of you</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:11.340
<b>in the last, final moments.</b>

10:11.340 --> 10:12.500
<b>Wait!</b>

10:12.500 --> 10:13.750
<b>Thank you.</b>

10:18.180 --> 10:19.010
<b>Huh?</b>

10:19.010 --> 10:20.930
<b>You stupid wench!</b>

10:21.220 --> 10:25.640
<b>For your sake, Kenshin and Yahiko
devoted themselves to rescuing you!</b>

10:25.640 --> 10:27.890
<b>And you want to ruin all of their efforts?</b>

10:27.890 --> 10:28.940
<b>Jeez!</b>

10:31.310 --> 10:33.610
<b>But there's nothing I can do.</b>

10:34.150 --> 10:38.490
<b>So many people are in agony
because of my opium,</b>

10:38.490 --> 10:42.450
<b>and yet I'm trying to be
the only one to avoid punishment.</b>

10:45.950 --> 10:47.450
<b>Kenshin, this ain't good!</b>

10:47.790 --> 10:48.910
<b>It's the cops!</b>

10:48.910 --> 10:51.130
<b>They heard all the ruckus and came over!</b>

10:51.380 --> 10:53.090
<b>We gotta get out of here quick!</b>

10:53.090 --> 10:55.300
<b>Come on! Don't just stand there!</b>

10:55.960 --> 10:56.800
<b>Hey!</b>

10:57.380 --> 10:58.220
<b>Ken-san.</b>

10:59.340 --> 11:01.340
<b>This is a family recipe, to stop bleeding.</b>

11:01.720 --> 11:05.140
<b>Treat the deep wound
on your chest with this.</b>

11:05.140 --> 11:06.180
<b>Then hurry to a doctor.</b>

11:06.720 --> 11:10.600
<b>Kanryu built a secret passageway
up in the attic.</b>

11:10.600 --> 11:12.900
<b>You can go through there
to get out of here.</b>

11:13.520 --> 11:14.940
<b>Thank you for all you have done.</b>

11:17.150 --> 11:19.490
<b>The penalty for illicit production
of opium is death.</b>

11:21.410 --> 11:24.200
<b>You are saying that while
being aware of that fact, that you are?</b>

11:24.200 --> 11:28.080
<b>Yes. People have died
because of the opium I made.</b>

11:28.580 --> 11:30.620
<b>I can't allow myself
to get away from here now.</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:36.960
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:38.880 --> 11:41.800
<b>Captain, we found
an illicit production area underground!</b>

11:42.050 --> 11:43.550
<b>All right, investigate!</b>

11:44.050 --> 11:47.470
<b>Sheesh. We had been spying on them,</b>

11:47.470 --> 11:51.230
<b>but I didn't imagine that he
secretly possessed a Gatling gun, too.</b>

11:53.100 --> 11:53.940
<b>You are...</b>

11:56.070 --> 11:57.650
<b>That's the woman!</b>

11:57.650 --> 12:00.860
<b>She's the one
that illicitly created opium!</b>

12:00.860 --> 12:03.360
<b>The woman who had a hand in all this!</b>

12:03.610 --> 12:05.620
<b>You can't make excuses, Megumi!</b>

12:05.620 --> 12:09.290
<b>No matter what the situation is,
you're the one that made the opium!</b>

12:09.290 --> 12:12.210
<b>We're together to the ends of hell!</b>

12:13.460 --> 12:14.670
<b>Is that true?</b>

12:15.210 --> 12:16.040
<b>Ye—</b>

12:16.040 --> 12:17.750
<b>The answer is "no," that it is.</b>

12:17.750 --> 12:18.710
<b>Mr. Himura?</b>

12:18.710 --> 12:19.550
<b>Wha—</b>

12:20.630 --> 12:23.720
<b>This person is an outstanding
doctor in training, that she is.</b>

12:23.720 --> 12:27.890
<b>He targeted her so he could force her
to make opium, that he did.</b>

12:28.140 --> 12:31.600
<b>Don't give them that baloney, Battosai!
That wench is—</b>

12:31.600 --> 12:33.100
<b>You stay quiet.</b>

12:34.310 --> 12:35.650
<b>Battosai?</b>

12:36.310 --> 12:38.360
<b>Isn't that right, Yahiko?</b>

12:39.280 --> 12:42.780
<b>Yeah! Tokyo samurai Yahiko Myojin</b>

12:42.780 --> 12:47.240
<b>won't ever swing a sword
for an illicit opium maker!</b>

12:47.490 --> 12:48.830
<b>Right, Sano?</b>

12:48.830 --> 12:50.540
<b>Like I'd know.</b>

12:50.540 --> 12:53.080
<b>I just tagged along for the fight.</b>

12:53.460 --> 12:56.000
<b>And there you have it, Captain, that is.</b>

12:57.290 --> 12:58.130
<b>Good enough?</b>

13:00.090 --> 13:01.260
<b>All right.</b>

13:01.800 --> 13:05.130
<b>We will conduct a more detailed
investigation at a later time.</b>

13:05.760 --> 13:09.390
<b>For today, you can take custody
of that woman, Mr. Himura.</b>

13:09.390 --> 13:10.850
<b>What's up with that?!</b>

13:11.020 --> 13:12.520
<b>That wench is an accomplice!</b>

13:12.520 --> 13:14.520
<b>- If you investigate, you'll soon see—
- Shut up!</b>

13:14.520 --> 13:16.310
<b>Hurry up, and take him away!</b>

13:16.310 --> 13:17.690
<b>- Yes, sir!
- Damn it!</b>

13:17.690 --> 13:18.810
<b>You're playing favorites!</b>

13:20.900 --> 13:22.190
<b>Don't touch!</b>

13:22.190 --> 13:24.700
<b>That's my Gatling gun!</b>

13:24.700 --> 13:26.700
<b>Don't violate it with your dirty hands!</b>

13:26.700 --> 13:27.660
<b>Hurry up, and walk!</b>

13:27.660 --> 13:31.540
<b>Gat!</b>

13:31.540 --> 13:34.250
<b>Well, things like this
are okay every so often.</b>

13:34.410 --> 13:36.330
<b>As long as it's only every so often.</b>

13:36.330 --> 13:38.750
<b>Ken-san, who in the world are you...</b>

13:39.250 --> 13:41.840
<b>The crime of murder
has a penalty of death.</b>

13:43.090 --> 13:47.010
<b>That is one way to atone for it,
but even if you were to die,</b>

13:47.010 --> 13:49.680
<b>the one you murdered won't
come back to life, that they won't.</b>

13:50.220 --> 13:54.390
<b>More than that, wielding a sword
for the sake of as many people as possible</b>

13:54.390 --> 13:57.140
<b>should be atonement
in the true sense of the word.</b>

13:58.150 --> 14:02.110
<b>That is how Hitokiri Battosai lives
in the current day, that he does.</b>

14:02.270 --> 14:04.320
<b>Hitokiri Battosai?</b>

14:04.320 --> 14:05.990
<b>The legendary one?</b>

14:05.990 --> 14:08.160
<b>The superior medical studies of Takani</b>

14:08.160 --> 14:11.740
<b>should be able to save more people
than the Battosai's sword.</b>

14:13.200 --> 14:16.000
<b>You should become a doctor,
Miss Megumi, that you should.</b>

14:16.960 --> 14:20.330
<b>Be of help to those
in agony from wounds and illnesses</b>

14:20.330 --> 14:22.420
<b>and not just opium, that you should.</b>

14:23.460 --> 14:26.510
<b>If you do that,
I'll let the bit about my buddy slide.</b>

14:26.510 --> 14:29.430
<b>If you do that,
you'll be able to see your family someday!</b>

14:30.010 --> 14:33.260
<b>Let's go home.
Miss Kaoru is waiting for us, that she is.</b>

14:35.980 --> 14:36.930
<b>Okay!</b>

14:38.310 --> 14:39.400
<b>Captain!</b>

14:40.400 --> 14:42.650
<b>About how you'll deal with Aoshi, that is—</b>

14:42.650 --> 14:45.190
<b>Aoshi? Who in the world is that?</b>

14:45.690 --> 14:49.410
<b>By who, I mean the tall man
wearing a coat that was here.</b>

14:49.610 --> 14:51.990
<b>There's no such man. When we rushed in,</b>

14:51.990 --> 14:55.620
<b>Kanryu Takeda was the only one
inside the dance hall.</b>

14:55.910 --> 14:59.460
<b>There were four beheaded corpses,
nothing else.</b>

15:00.620 --> 15:02.750
<b>Aoshi disappeared?</b>

15:03.630 --> 15:05.670
<b>There isn't one window in this place.</b>

15:05.670 --> 15:08.510
<b>That means he should have escaped
through the entrance below!</b>

15:08.510 --> 15:11.090
<b>All entrances
are secured with police officers!</b>

15:11.300 --> 15:14.310
<b>It's impossible for someone to escape
without anyone noticing!</b>

15:14.680 --> 15:17.640
<b>No, there is another entrance,
that there is.</b>

15:18.390 --> 15:19.850
<b>Kanryu's secret passageway!</b>

15:20.270 --> 15:21.900
<b>Where is the exit for the passageway?</b>

15:21.900 --> 15:23.610
<b>It leads out to the grove in the back.</b>

15:23.770 --> 15:25.320
<b>I'll guide you there!</b>

15:26.900 --> 15:28.650
<b>The exit is open.</b>

15:28.990 --> 15:30.910
<b>So he definitely passed through here.</b>

15:30.910 --> 15:33.620
<b>Look around!
He is surely still somewhere around here!</b>

15:34.070 --> 15:34.990
<b>Aoshi...</b>

15:52.890 --> 15:54.510
<b>Wh-What are you doing?</b>

15:54.510 --> 15:56.350
<b>Hurry up, and capture him!</b>

15:56.350 --> 15:57.640
<b>Stop it.</b>

15:57.640 --> 15:59.430
<b>You guys will just get killed.</b>

16:00.850 --> 16:02.520
<b>It's not your fault.</b>

16:02.770 --> 16:05.610
<b>They died so that you could live.</b>

16:06.110 --> 16:08.400
<b>But they surely
don't hold a grudge about that.</b>

16:09.150 --> 16:09.990
<b>Aoshi...</b>

16:10.530 --> 16:12.360
<b>fight me one more time.</b>

16:13.910 --> 16:16.120
<b>Fight me, defeat me,</b>

16:16.120 --> 16:19.500
<b>and adorn the word "strongest"
on the graves of those four.</b>

16:23.580 --> 16:24.670
<b>Battosai...</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:29.630
<b>until I kill you,
make sure nobody else kills you.</b>

16:31.090 --> 16:32.680
<b>Don't let him get away! After him!</b>

16:36.260 --> 16:37.430
<b>Kenshin...</b>

16:38.510 --> 16:40.140
<b>This is how it should be, that it is.</b>

16:40.720 --> 16:43.480
<b>Words of consolation
are unnecessary for now.</b>

16:43.730 --> 16:47.440
<b>But then, this means that you will be
the perpetual target now!</b>

16:47.900 --> 16:50.280
<b>It's all right, that it is.</b>

16:51.530 --> 16:54.240
<b>Now we should go home for real this time.</b>

16:57.780 --> 16:59.740
<b>Welcome back!</b>

17:00.080 --> 17:00.950
<b>We're back.</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:04.160
<b>Wait, you're covered
in terrible wounds.</b>

17:04.160 --> 17:06.540
<b>Your fingers as well, Miss Kaoru.</b>

17:06.540 --> 17:09.380
<b>Well, in any case,
thank you for a job well done!</b>

17:09.380 --> 17:13.670
<b>I have both a breakfast and a bath ready,
so go on ahead!</b>

17:13.670 --> 17:15.800
<b>I'm tired, so I'm gonna sleep first.</b>

17:15.800 --> 17:17.260
<b>Me, too.</b>

17:19.260 --> 17:22.220
<b>I made it just for you guys!</b>

17:22.220 --> 17:23.640
<b>Is that so?</b>

17:23.640 --> 17:24.730
<b>So sleepy!</b>

17:24.940 --> 17:27.190
<b>I will have some, that I will.</b>

17:27.190 --> 17:28.310
<b>M-Me, too.</b>

17:29.570 --> 17:31.110
<b>Is it okay...</b>

17:31.110 --> 17:32.360
<b>for me to have some?</b>

17:35.070 --> 17:36.160
<b>- Of course!
- Of course!</b>

18:05.310 --> 18:06.310
<b>Tastes awful.</b>

18:14.190 --> 18:16.530
<b>Thank you for all you have done for me.</b>

18:16.650 --> 18:21.950
<b>I'm sorry. This place isn't that big,
and I can't have any more house guests.</b>

18:21.950 --> 18:25.160
<b>As you know, a certain someone
comes by for free meals every day.</b>

18:26.210 --> 18:27.870
<b>Oh, don't worry.</b>

18:27.870 --> 18:31.290
<b>You even referred me for a live-in job.</b>

18:31.540 --> 18:35.420
<b>Mr. Gensai being her guarantor
was a lifesaver, that it was.</b>

18:35.590 --> 18:40.510
<b>Oh, I'd welcome an assistant
like Miss Megumi anytime.</b>

18:40.970 --> 18:42.640
<b>Um, Ken-san...</b>

18:42.640 --> 18:43.470
<b>Oro?</b>

18:43.850 --> 18:46.140
<b>If you ever get sick of Kaoru,
let me know.</b>

18:46.640 --> 18:49.480
<b>I can be your companion anytime you want.</b>

18:50.560 --> 18:52.230
<b>Companion for what?</b>

18:52.230 --> 18:54.610
<b>Hurry up, and get lost, you fox!</b>

18:57.440 --> 18:59.110
<b>I told you before...</b>

18:59.110 --> 19:02.700
<b>that missie is simpleminded,
so don't joke around and tease her.</b>

19:02.700 --> 19:05.620
<b>Oh, but I was serious about that.</b>

19:05.620 --> 19:08.370
<b>I'd only be joking if the companion
was someone of your caliber.</b>

19:08.870 --> 19:10.670
<b>You pickin' a fight with me?</b>

19:11.250 --> 19:13.210
<b>Don't be jealous. No jealousy.</b>

19:13.210 --> 19:16.170
<b>If you brush up on your manliness
to get to Ken-san's level,</b>

19:16.170 --> 19:17.380
<b>I can be your companion.</b>

19:17.800 --> 19:23.600
<b>Man, I thought you'd be a little more
decent after all this, but not at all!</b>

19:23.970 --> 19:25.430
<b>You're a fool.</b>

19:25.430 --> 19:27.270
<b>When you're 22 years old,</b>

19:27.270 --> 19:29.770
<b>you can't correct
your personality anymore.</b>

19:31.400 --> 19:34.230
<b>That sounds like a line
I heard somewhere else.</b>

19:34.770 --> 19:43.780
<b>NO FEMALE FOXES
ALLOWED ENTRY!</b>

19:35.150 --> 19:38.030
<b>So in the end,
what judgment did she receive?</b>

19:38.530 --> 19:43.160
<b>It seems they settled for her becoming
a witness for the case, that they did.</b>

19:45.120 --> 19:48.580
<b>However, in the end,
Aoshi is still missing.</b>

19:49.080 --> 19:55.040
<b>So did you really make yourself a target
to give him a reason to live?</b>

19:55.500 --> 19:57.460
<b>Until he heals his wounds</b>

19:57.460 --> 20:01.590
<b>and gains confidence and skill
to definitely beat me.</b>

20:02.430 --> 20:04.970
<b>Next time, I'm not sure
if I would be able to win.</b>

20:04.970 --> 20:06.470
<b>What ya talkin' about?</b>

20:06.470 --> 20:09.230
<b>There's absolutely no way
Kenshin would lose!</b>

20:11.940 --> 20:13.060
<b>By the way, Sano...</b>

20:13.440 --> 20:16.770
<b>did you speak with Shikijo at all,
that you did?</b>

20:16.770 --> 20:18.940
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

20:19.110 --> 20:21.530
<b>Well, back in Kanryu's mansion...</b>

20:22.740 --> 20:26.370
<b><i>That bird head has quite the potential.</i></b>

20:26.370 --> 20:27.740
<b><i>Take good care of him.</i></b>

20:28.540 --> 20:30.620
<b>Don't know.</b>

20:30.620 --> 20:33.830
<b>We punched, punched,
and punched some more.</b>

20:33.830 --> 20:35.420
<b>That's about it.</b>

20:35.420 --> 20:36.920
<b>I see, so it was...</b>

20:38.800 --> 20:43.180
<b>I wish we were able to chat with them
a bit more, that I do.</b>

20:43.880 --> 20:45.260
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

22:23.440 --> 22:25.440
<b>I cannot put flowers at your graves yet.</b>

22:25.820 --> 22:28.280
<b>But someday, I will make sure to...</b>

22:29.370 --> 22:30.830
<b>What are you doing?</b>

22:31.330 --> 22:33.160
<b>You're all alone so deep in the mountains.</b>

22:33.740 --> 22:35.660
<b>H-Hey! That way is no good!</b>

22:36.080 --> 22:39.250
<b>That's a dense forest
that the locals never approach!</b>

22:39.880 --> 22:43.300
<b>Hey, can't you hear me? Hey!</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
YAHIKO'S BATTLE</b>

22:46.720 --> 22:49.390
<b><i>Next episode, "Yahiko's Battle."</i></b>
